sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client / Browser
    participant API as EduAlto Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/me/profile/avatar/upload-url (contentType, contentLength)
    API->>API: Validate MIME (jpeg/png/webp) & Size (<= 5MB)
    API->>R2: Generate Presigned PUT URL (key: avatars/{userId}/avatar.ext, TTL: 15m)
    API-->>User: 200 OK (uploadUrl, objectKey, expiresAt)

    User->>R2: HTTP PUT [uploadUrl] (binary file body)
    R2-->>User: 200 OK

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/me/profile/avatar/complete (objectKey)
    API->>API: Check userId ownership in objectKey
    API->>R2: HeadObject (verify exists, contentType, size <= 5MB)
    API->>DB: Update profiles.avatar_key = objectKey
    opt Has previous avatarKey != newKey
        API->>R2: DeleteObject(previousKey)
    end
    API-->>User: 200 OK (avatarKey, avatarUrl)
